      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Circuit breaker state per endpoint",
      "description": "0 closed, 1 half-open, 2 open. A breaker that flaps between open and half-open is an endpoint that keeps failing its recovery probe.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
